---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="HIPAA-Compliant Call Tracking" description="Know which marketing efforts drive real dental appointments with HIPAA-compliant call tracking — powered by CallOwl, by PPC Dentist.">

  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-brand-teal/10 text-brand-teal text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6">Is Your Marketing Making Money?</span>
          <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-brand-dark leading-tight mb-6">
            HIPAA-Compliant<br />Call Tracking for<br /><em class="font-display italic font-normal">Dentists</em>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md">
            Without HIPAA-compliant call tracking, you have no way of knowing if your marketing dollars are turning into production dollars. Know exactly which campaigns drive real appointments.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-slate hover:bg-brand-dark text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-md transition-colors">
            Get Started &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-gray-200">
            <img src="/hero-call-tracking.jpg" alt="HIPAA-compliant call tracking" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">

        <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">Without HIPAA-compliant call tracking, you have no way of knowing if your marketing dollars are turning into production dollars.</p>
          <p>Call tracking techniques such as Dynamic Number Insertion (DNI) are critical for tying your marketing efforts to actual production numbers. Our HIPAA-compliant call tracking service is specifically designed for dentists who want to track ROI for their organic and PPC traffic.</p>
          <p>Our service includes a Google Analytics 4 setup audit and implementation of best practices (a $500 value) as well as an AI overview of calls* so we can determine if a call leads to a booked appointment or not (*depends upon state/local law).</p>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100 space-y-4">
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-700 text-brand-dark">What's Included</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {[
                'Dynamic Number Insertion (DNI) for PPC and organic',
                'AI-powered call summary — booked vs. not booked',
                'Google Analytics 4 integration and configuration',
                'Monthly reporting you can actually read',
              ].map(item => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-teal shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-red hover:bg-red-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-colors text-sm">
            Claim Your 30-Day Free Trial
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Why HIPAA matters -->
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-brand-slate rounded-2xl p-7 text-white">
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-700 mb-3">Why HIPAA Compliance Matters for Call Tracking</h3>
            <p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">Most call tracking platforms were not built with healthcare in mind. Storing or transmitting patient information — including the fact that someone called a dental office — can constitute PHI under HIPAA. We use HIPAA-compliant call tracking to help minimize potential exposure.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-700 text-brand-dark mb-3">Sample Data</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Our reporting shows you exactly which campaigns, keywords, and channels are driving calls — and whether those calls converted to booked appointments. The office is the one who listed the NP status and the revenue.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 italic">Sample report available on request.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
